{"id":"a606838813c14669","group":"90","path":"90/90-lem-t-predicate.md","title":"T-predicate Lemma","display":"lem-t-predicate — T-predicate Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-lem-t-predicate","aliases":["90-lem-t-predicate"],"display":"lem-t-predicate — T-predicate Lemma","depends_on":["[[90-df-t-predicate]]","[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[90-df-machine-coding]]","[[90-lem-sequence-coding]]","[[90-lem-program-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-lem-t-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-lem-t-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-t-predicate — T-predicate Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"48b1cea94ba27d41\" href=\"?note=48b1cea94ba27d41\" title=\"90-df-t-predicate\">90-df-t-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"01ab533da9c8c517\" href=\"?note=01ab533da9c8c517\" title=\"90-df-machine-coding\">90-df-machine-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1cdf7925a164f89d\" href=\"?note=1cdf7925a164f89d\" title=\"90-lem-sequence-coding\">90-lem-sequence-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_k\">\\(T_k\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"48b1cea94ba27d41\" href=\"?note=48b1cea94ba27d41\" title=\"90-df-t-predicate\">90-df-t-predicate</a>，程序与配置编码见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"01ab533da9c8c517\" href=\"?note=01ab533da9c8c517\" title=\"90-df-machine-coding\">90-df-machine-coding</a>，序列算法见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1cdf7925a164f89d\" href=\"?note=1cdf7925a164f89d\" title=\"90-lem-sequence-coding\">90-lem-sequence-coding</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRPred}\">\\(\\mathrm{PRPred}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_k\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_{k+2}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_k\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_{k+2}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>程序合法性、初态编码、配置码验证、一次转移、末态读取均为固定有界序列操作。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;\\mathrm{Len}(y)\">\\(i&lt;\\mathrm{Len}(y)\\)</span> 合取这些检验得到特征函数；构造细节和非法代码分支见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"01ab533da9c8c517\" href=\"?note=01ab533da9c8c517\" title=\"90-df-machine-coding\">90-df-machine-coding</a>，统一验证见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>元数计入程序指标和历史代码。证明不以“标准编码”作为未展开前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-t-predicate